          "jcr:created": "Mon Jul 25 2022 18:46:47 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">Program objectives</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Understand how to identify a periprosthetic hip fr</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">acture</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Understand the Vancouver classification system for classifying periprosthetic femoral fractures</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Understand treatment options for addressing periprosthetic hip fractures&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Understand patient indications, cemented stem options and patient outcomes and survivorship for treating periprosthetic fractures&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Apr 11 2025 14:43:45 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        },
